## The "Burner" Strategy: Beating IP Blocks
In the ongoing "arms race" of internet censorship, specific IP addresses are often blacklisted. 

Because Doprax uses **per-hour billing**, you have a strategic advantage. If your VPN stops working because the IP is blocked, you can simply **destroy the VM** and spin up a new one. You’ll receive a fresh IP address in minutes and only pay for the few hours the previous VM was active.

